 *     with basements; Prince Albert Road villas; the estate built 1840 to 1870).
 *   - Stop below an original cornice: facts table (10 Nov Hampstead, 23 Nov
 *     Camden). Run to the ceiling with the cornice across the top: K21 (his
 *     preference) and the alcove units guide ("compatible cornice can run
 *     across the front").
 *   - Full-height doors or top cupboards for suitcases and winter clothes: the
 *     built-in wardrobe guide he approved, 24 Oct ("separate top cupboards ...
 *     give bedding or luggage their own space"; "Higher cupboards are useful
 *     for seasonal clothes, spare bedding and luggage").
