 *     table (8 Nov Hampstead).
 *   - FAQ, worth it: the alcove units guide's standfirst ("useful storage and a
 *     place to display"; "help shape the whole wall").
 *   - FAQ, how high: the alcove units guide ("Bespoke units have no standard set
