 * gave way to questions people ask on the product searches. The freeholder
 * question stays: many homes here are flats in converted houses.
 *
 * FAQ sources: "How much does alcove storage cost?" and "How high should
 * alcove units be?" (Google People also ask, alcove units london, London,
 * desktop, 15 Nov 2026), answered from the alcove units guide he approved
 * (the unit the guide price covers; cupboard height sets the split between
 * storage and display; matching cupboard tops across unequal alcoves); "Do I
 * need my freeholder's permission ...?" (ops deliverables/faq-research-
