 * leasehold property?"). Dropped: "Will you protect the floors ...?" (B8) and
 * "How soon could you start ...?" (B4).
 *
 * A FOUNDER'S EIGHT COMMENTS, 15 Nov 2026 (internal, on the review link):
 * - A line drawing beside four sections (AreaSide.astro, drawings in
 *   src/data/area-drawings.ts): "examples of what the text describes on the
 *   right side". Drawings, not photographs: a photograph of a local house
 *   would read as a job here.
 * - The guide prices as cards with each service's drawing (PriceCards.astro):
 *   "an illustration on the right side with visuals and pricing for each".
 *   The figures are the service pages' own (site.ts), unchanged.
 * - The customer review line is cut ("Me as a reader what do I get from
 *   this?"). It also named an area Kaspar had not confirmed, so the question
 *   card asking him to check it goes too.
 * - "How much does alcove storage cost?" is replaced: it repeated the price
 *   section (FAQs add to the page, never restate it). Now "Are alcove
 *   cupboards worth it?": Google People also ask on both "alcove units
 *   london" and "alcove cupboards" (UK, English, desktop, the built-in
 *   browser, 15 Nov 2026; DataForSEO answered 402 that day). Answered from
 *   the alcove units guide he approved (its standfirst, "useful storage and a
 *   place to display", and "Cupboards can sit flush with the chimney breast
